            "value": "v1"
          }
        ]
      },
      "tier": "detail",
      "quote": "version (default v1)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Attachment through an IAM group is accepted, because every user ends up with the policy. Two checks cover it: all 20 users have an attachment route, and the policy itself is attached to users or a group. Users in one group with the policy on another group would pass; that can't be bound without logical IDs."
}
